      <div class="uc-panel active" id="uc-1">
        <div class="uc-copy">
          <h3>Visual Arts & Crafts</h3>
          <p>From murals to canvas, woven textiles to beadwork, our visual artists translate everyday life into colour and form — drawing on tradition while speaking to the present. Every piece begins as a shared idea before it becomes a single artist's work, keeping techniques alive that have been passed down for generations, so that no two pieces are ever quite the same.</p>
        </div>
        <img class="ph uc-image" src="/webp/Art Narratives 26 May 2026-11.webp" alt="Botaki Ba Afrika brass performance">
      </div>
      <div class="uc-panel" id="uc-2">
        <div class="uc-copy">
          <h3>Music</h3>
          <p>Percussion, voice, and melody carry the collective's stories from one gathering to the next. Our musicians write and perform together, treating every rehearsal as a small community event.</p>
        </div>
       <img class="ph uc-image" src="/webp/26-05-31 DTM-4.webp" alt="Botaki Ba Afrika music performance">
      </div>
      <div class="uc-panel" id="uc-3">
        <div class="uc-copy">
          <h3>Literature</h3>
          <p>Our writers work in poetry, short prose, and oral storytelling, often performed aloud before they're ever written down. Language here is a shared instrument, passed between generations.</p>
        </div>
        <img class="ph uc-image" src="/webp/Peotry Sessions - 18 Aug 2021 (102).webp" alt="Botaki Ba Afrika brass performance">
      </div>
